Bundled third-party code
========================

src/vendor/nanoarrow/
---------------------

This directory vendors the core and IPC components of the Apache Arrow
nanoarrow C library, release apache-arrow-nanoarrow-0.9.0, upstream commit
9fad80292360d0f3978264c11ba865ccc94020d8, from
https://github.com/apache/arrow-nanoarrow. The archive, its SHA-512 and the
checksum of every vendored file are recorded in src/vendor/PROVENANCE.

