Local modifications
-------------------

The files are upstream's output of its own bundling script, with two local
patches applied. flatcc/portable/pdiagnostic.h and
nanoarrow_ipc_flatcc_generated.h are modified, and each says so at its top
(Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)). The patches are in tools/patches/ in the
source repository and are listed in src/vendor/PROVENANCE.
